Here's the Java implementation:

```java
public class PowerOfThreeChecker {
    // The largest power of three within the 32-bit signed integer range
    private static final int MAX_POWER_OF_THREE = 1162261467; // 3^19

    public static boolean isPowerOfThree(int n) {
        // Check if n is positive and divides the largest power of three
        return n > 0 && MAX_POWER_OF_THREE % n == 0;
    }

